flowchart TB
    U[User message<br/>PII redacted] --> L[LLM<br/>sees only the tools the role may use]
    L -->|tool call| P{{Policy<br/>role × tool}}
    P -->|allow| R[Validate args → run<br/>timeout, retry → redact output]
    P -->|approve| Q[Paused: awaiting approval]
    Q -->|approved by someone<br/>other than the requester| R
    Q -->|denied| N
    P -->|deny| N[Not run<br/>model told: not permitted]
    R & N --> B[Result back to the LLM]
    B -->|next step| L
    B --> F[Final answer]
    F ~~~ S[Every step: budgets checked · every event → audit chain · spans → trace]
    style S stroke-dasharray: 4 3
